4.Add the vpws-vxlan-instances container in configuration/l2vpn/service-instances.
5.Add the max-traffic-rate-params in configuration/l2vpn/service-instances/vpls-instances/vpls-instance/martini-discovery/pw-details-params/pw-details.' ;
  }

