  revision 2013-10-23 {
    description '1. Add the revision of 2013-10-23.
2. Modify the features in according with function.
3. Add the container of l2vpn-enable and delete the global-enable nodes enumeration value of disable.
4. The qos-mode service-class and colour nodes delete the enumeration value of null.
5. The minimum of traffic-statistics related nodes is changed from 1 to 0,for example,unicast-inrate-bps,unicast-inrate-pps,broadcast-inrate-bps,drop-inrate-bps.
6. The value of sdh-sonet node is changed from boolean to enumeration.
7. Delete the cell-concatenation node,because this version does not have this function.
8. The value of split-horizon node which in vpls-ac-bind container is changed from spoke/hub to server/client.
9. The name of ingress-tag-as-payload changed to ingress-adjust-tag-as-payload.
10. The name of begin-ve-block changed to begin-ve-id,The name of end-ve-block changed to end-ve-id.
11. fcs-retention-headlength-flag,fr-dlci-header-length,cas-trunk-type,async-type and cword-usage-forced nodes delete the enumeration value of null.
12. Add the container of tdm-parameters.
13. Add the leaf nodes of oam-mapping-ignoring-frr and abort-mapping-to-ac.
14. Delete the leaf nodes of coworker-proxy-ac.
15. Add the container of l2vpn-statistics for clear the L2VPN all statistics.' ;
  }

  revision 2013-08-14 {
    description "The second version.The changes are as follows:
    1.Increasing the operation object model;
    2.In order to use the MIB object,modify the following object ID:
    status/l2vpn/statistics/instance-statistics's object ID modified from 14572 to 14339;
    status/l2vpn/statistics/pw-statistics's object ID modified from 14573 to 14340;     status/l2vpn/statistics/ac-statistics-s object ID modified from 14574 to 14341;
    3. The configuration attribute removed of status/l2vpn/statistics node." ;
  }

  revision 2013-06-20 {
    description 'Initial version.' ;
  }

